      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yeah its a bit non-trivial :-). Took me a while to get the conditions correct - start_pfn and last_pfn should not be inside a superpage, but its okay for start_pfn to be the first page of a superpage and last_pfn to be the last page in a superpage.\n\nI agree that this is not strictly needed if we don\u0027t bother partial unmaps from a request and a well behaved host would not make such a request.\n\nWill remove this.",
